      "message": "fix(kernel): turn only a one-shell solid outward; judge the snap move\n\nReview of #2843:\n- The inward turn now needs one shell (mesh_weld::shells). A solid with\n  a void and a negative volume stays the Volume refusal.\n- The tolerance check adds SNAP_MOVE_MM (sqrt(3) * SNAP_WINDOW_MM) to the\n  measured deviation.\n- The decision file says the adaptive bound is one-sided.\n\nRefs #917\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
